\details{
Pairing / blocking: when the annotation has a \code{subject} column, \code{blocking = "fixed"}
adds the subject as a fixed effect (what the original paired tests did);
\code{"random"} uses \code{duplicateCorrelation}; \code{"auto"} picks \code{"fixed"} when every subject
